@page "/about"
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>About BloodLink | Blood supply coordination</PageTitle>
<a class="bl-skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
<PublicHeader />
<main id="main-content" class="bl-about-page">
    <section class="bl-about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <div class="bl-container bl-about-hero-grid">
            <div><span class="bl-eyebrow">About BloodLink</span><h1 id="about-title">A shared workspace for coordinated blood supply.</h1><p>BloodLink helps healthcare facilities organise inventory information and manage requests through one connected platform.</p><a class="bl-btn bl-btn-danger bl-btn-lg" href="/facility/register">Register your facility</a></div>
            <img src="images/bloodlink-lab.webp" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="A laboratory professional checking a sealed blood unit and its records" />
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="bl-section bl-about-sections" aria-label="About BloodLink">
        <div class="bl-container bl-about-grid">
            <article><span class="bl-card-icon"><AppIcon Name="package" Size="22" /></span><h2>What BloodLink does</h2><p>It gives authorised facility teams tools to record blood inventory, follow request activity, and coordinate availability with other facilities.</p></article>
            <article><span class="bl-card-icon"><AppIcon Name="network" Size="22" /></span><h2>Why coordination matters</h2><p>Facility teams need clear, current information to understand supply and respond to changing needs. A shared workflow can make that information easier to manage.</p></article>
            <article><span class="bl-card-icon"><AppIcon Name="building" Size="22" /></span><h2>How facilities collaborate</h2><p>Facilities maintain their own inventory and use requests to communicate needs and responses within the BloodLink workspace.</p></article>
            <article><span class="bl-card-icon"><AppIcon Name="activity" Size="22" /></span><h2>Our product mission</h2><p>Make the operational work around blood supply more organised, visible, and straightforward for healthcare teams.</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section class="bl-cta-section" aria-labelledby="about-cta-title"><div class="bl-container bl-cta-inner"><div><h2 id="about-cta-title">Coordinate from one workspace.</h2><p>Register a facility or sign in to continue.</p></div><div class="bl-action-row"><a class="bl-btn bl-btn-light bl-btn-lg" href="/facility/register">Register facility</a><a class="bl-btn bl-btn-ghost-light bl-btn-lg" href="/account/login">Facility sign in</a></div></div></section>
</main>
<PublicFooter />
